"""Install the owner's CurseForge modpack server pack and run it.

The owner's API key arrives only as the file named by CF_API_KEY_FILE. It is sent
only to https://api.curseforge.com as the x-api-key header and is never logged,
written to /data or passed in a process argument.
"""
